  "description": "Project-independent Roslyn rules for C#: formatting, naming, documentation requirements, readability, async hygiene and auth hygiene. AVIG0001-AVIG0024, eight with a code fix. The rules report as suggestions until you raise the severity yourself in .editorconfig; four of the nineteen are warnings out of the box.",
